    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl from a small village picks up the Wand of Stars and embarks on a journey with her companions.<br>Along the way, she will encounter all kinds of adventures and challenges\u2014<br>What awaits her at the end of the journey?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice</strong>: A curious girl from a small village who sets off on a journey to explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momor</strong>: A &quot;ghost&quot; girl from the demon realm who has come to observe the human world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spinel</strong>: A girl imbued with the power of spinel, symbolizing fulfillment, curiosity, and uniqueness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaelorei</strong>: A solitary girl who roams the world in pursuit of her own ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many more characters waiting for players to discover...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Classic turn-based RPG gameplay, with many characters joining your party along the way<br>\u25a0 A wide variety of skills and enemies that encourage thoughtful strategies<br>\u25a0 Many adorable characters you can interact with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys: Move<br>Enter / Space: Confirm / Talk<br>Esc: Menu / Cancel<br>Shift: Hold to run or walk<br>\u3000\u3000\u3000(Speed up text during dialogue)<br>Ctrl: Skip dialogue<br>Tab: Show/hide dialogue box during conversations<br>A: Show dialogue log<br>F2: Display FPS counter</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl from a small village picks up the Wand of Stars and embarks on a journey with her companions.<br>Along the way, she will encounter all kinds of adventures and challenges\u2014<br>What awaits her at the end of the journey?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice</strong>: A curious girl from a small village who sets off on a journey to explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momor</strong>: A &quot;ghost&quot; girl from the demon realm who has come to observe the human world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spinel</strong>: A girl imbued with the power of spinel, symbolizing fulfillment, curiosity, and uniqueness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaelorei</strong>: A solitary girl who roams the world in pursuit of her own ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many more characters waiting for players to discover...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Classic turn-based RPG gameplay, with many characters joining your party along the way<br>\u25a0 A wide variety of skills and enemies that encourage thoughtful strategies<br>\u25a0 Many adorable characters you can interact with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys: Move<br>Enter / Space: Confirm / Talk<br>Esc: Menu / Cancel<br>Shift: Hold to run or walk<br>\u3000\u3000\u3000(Speed up text during dialogue)<br>Ctrl: Skip dialogue<br>Tab: Show/hide dialogue box during conversations<br>A: Show dialogue log<br>F2: Display FPS counter</p>",
    "short_description": "A girl from a small village,pick up the star stick,embark on a journey. There are various adventures and challenges to be encountered during the journey. What awaits the girl?",
